               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Fabrikat; altena GmbH info@altena-licht.de</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Typ: 907.NPS1-NAVI2/CFW-IP65PR </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">oder gleichwertig</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">gewähltes Fabrikat: Instalighting</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Typ: OHR2 N27 1035 927 A2 L2</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Wird kein anderes Produkt eingetragen, so gilt das Leitprodukt als angeboten.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>LED Lichtkanal Radweg</span>
