              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Ausführung: Basaltvorsatz anthrazit (Splitt/Sand), Stärke &#x3e; 6 mm, Bindemittel anthrazit eingefärbt</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Oberfläche: Noppenplatte unbehandelt</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Noppenform: Kugelkalotte</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Noppenanordnung: 32 Tastnoppen in versetzter Anordnung (diagonal)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
