              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Gehäusefarbe: DB703</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Abmessung l/b/h: ca. 650/310/120 mm</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Schutzklasse II, Schutzart IP 65</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Lichtquelle: Integriertes LED-Modul</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Systemleistung: 10 bis 90 W (je nach Konfiguration)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Lichtstrom: 850 bis 11100 lm (je nach Konfiguration)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Farbtemperatur: Warmweiß: 3.000 K</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Farbwiedergabeindex: Neutralweiß 70</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Mastzopf für Aufsatzmontage: 76 mm oder</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Mastzopf für Ansatzmontage: 42-60 mm</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Den vorgegebenen Anforderungen entspricht z.B.:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Fabrikat: AEC ILLUMINAZIONE GmbH  </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Typ: ITALO</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">angebotenes Fabrikat/Typ des Bieters:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Name:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">AEC ILLUMINAZIONE GmbH </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">.......................................................</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Bei Nichtausfüllung des angebotenen Fabrikates gilt die</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Angabe des Leitproduktes als vertraglicher Bestandteil.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Mastansatzleuchte liefern, LED Warmweiß 3000 K, bis 11100 lm</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
