               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Bestandswurzeln ist zu unterlassen!</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Ausführung: kreuzweise Aufreißen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Gilt für Homogenitätsbereiche &#x22;A&#x22;, &#x22;B&#x22; und &#x22;D&#x22; und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">gelieferten Boden</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Bearbeitungstiefe: ca. 15 cm</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">besondere Hinweise: Steine ab 5 cm Durchmesser,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Fremdkörper und schwer verrottbare Pflanzenteile vor</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Ausführung ablesen und gemäß Kreislaufwirtschaftsgesetz</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">entsorgen, die Kosten sind einzukalkulieren.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Einbauort: gemäß Lageplan</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Abrechnung: nach Flächenaufmaß</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Untergrund / Unterbau vor Auftrag der Vegetations-</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
            <!-- GAEB version used: 330 -->
            <!-- GAEB version used: 330 -->
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="AAAAAAABIEHGMAMI" RNoPart="30">
          <Qty>28.000</Qty>
          <QU>m3</QU>
          <Description ID="R20240103193122773000627">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Pflanzgrube herstellen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Baumstandort/Baumgrube herstellen </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">nach Entfernen Asphalt/Betonpflasterschicht und Tragschichten.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Tiefe gesamt: 1,50 m</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Verzahnung mit dem Unterboden herstellen, durch Aufreißen der Pflanzgrubensohle mind. 15 cm.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Verdichtungen, auch an Grubenwänden sind zu beseitigen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Unbrauchbaren Boden aufnehmen und fachgerecht verwerten.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Pflanzgrube herstellen</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
            <!-- GAEB version used: 330 -->
            <!-- GAEB version used: 330 -->
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="AAAAAAABIEHGNMCI" RNoPart="40">
          <Qty>60.000</Qty>
          <QU>m3</QU>
          <Description ID="R20240103193122777000628">
           <CompleteText>
            <ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Baumsubstrat liefern und einbauen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Baumsubstrat liefern, einbauen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">und statisch verdichten (zwischen 83 und 87 % DPR).</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Bodensubstrat gem. FLL </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Empfehlung für Baumpflanzung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Teil 2 - Abb. 5a Pflanzgrubenbauweise 1</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">mit grundlegenden und prüfbaren Substrateigenschaften</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">und gütegesichert</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Einbaustelle: eingefasste Baumscheibe</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Größe: variabel je nach Baumscheibe</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Tiefe: 1,50 m</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">lagenweiser Einbau </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Substratkorngröße: 0/32 mm</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Liefernachweiss: Vulkatec GmbH</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Im Pommernfeld 2</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">56630 Kretz / Andernach</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Tel.: 02632 9548-0</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">E-mail: info@vulkatec.de</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">oder gleichwertig (Zertifikat FLL Prüfzeugnis oder </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">RAL Gütesicherung ist einzureichen).</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Angebotenes Erzeugnis:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <TextComplement MarkLbl="60" Kind="Bidder" Empty="Yes">
               <ComplCaption/>
               <ComplBody>
                <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">&#x27;</span>
                <br/>
                <br/>
                <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">....................................................&#x27;</span>
               </ComplBody>
               <ComplTail/>
              </TextComplement>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Baumsubstrat liefern und einbauen</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
