               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Verankerung Pfahl-Dreibock L 300 cm</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:@Arial Unicode MS;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Pflanzenverankerung</span>
